**Patch Plan:**
- In `src/ol/renderer/webgl/TileLayer.js`, when fetching tiles, check if the source projection and view projection differ. If so, use the reprojection mechanism (i.e., get a `ReprojTile`).
- This is similar to what the standard tile renderer does.

